    "updated_at": "2018-09-06T08:05:59Z",
    "body": "> To clarify OP, this would only affect `importScripts()`?\r\n\r\nCorrect. That's the subset we have solid numbers for, and that looks like we can tighten without visible impact on users. `new Worker()` and `<script>` still look a bit out of reach (though I'm hopeful about the former).",
