    "updated_at": "2023-02-09T08:24:28Z",
    "body": "https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/1917528 says Chrome's exclusion of `blob:`, `filesystem:`, and `data:` was intentional to match Firefox. I don't imagine this is too common, but we'd need to gather some metrics to determine whether we can change the behavior safely.\r\n\r\n",
